WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.920 --> 00:03.080
Kum.

3
00:03.080 --> 00:04.320
I want to go public.

4
00:04.320 --> 00:05.600
Is that a good idea, Anda?

5
00:05.600 --> 00:08.200
Your family isn't okay with this, are they?

6
00:08.200 --> 00:09.311
Anda.

7
00:09.311 --> 00:10.760
Why did you come home so early?

8
00:10.760 --> 00:13.622
You know what your dad is like lately.

9
00:15.760 --> 00:18.533
Can you pretend you're hitting on me?

10
00:18.533 --> 00:19.622
Okay.

11
00:19.622 --> 00:22.520
I'll hit on you.

12
00:22.520 --> 00:24.120
Sheesh...

13
00:24.120 --> 00:25.720
Is my friend about to get into a relationship?

14
00:25.720 --> 00:28.488
If that's the case, the rivalry between the two faculties is over.

15
00:28.488 --> 00:30.000
Now they're two loving faculties.

16
00:30.000 --> 00:31.400
I've got this for you.

17
00:31.400 --> 00:32.933
I think you'll like it.

18
00:36.133 --> 00:38.080
Where did you get this?

19
00:50.800 --> 00:53.880
Hey, are those the freshmen?

20
00:55.253 --> 00:57.844
Yeah. They probably just got back from camp.

21
00:57.844 --> 00:58.880
- See you. - Let me talk to him.

22
00:58.880 --> 01:01.333
That kid, what's his name?

23
01:01.333 --> 01:04.222
It's Satang, a first-year Automotive Engineering student.

24
01:06.633 --> 01:08.440
Hello, hello.

25
01:12.080 --> 01:14.520
How are things? Was the camp fun?

26
01:14.520 --> 01:15.955
It was.

27
01:15.955 --> 01:19.511
But I almost got my face burned off. It was scorching hot.

28
01:19.511 --> 01:21.280
I thought you'd be there, too.

29
01:21.280 --> 01:23.440
Us, really? How would we even make it?

30
01:23.440 --> 01:25.280
We already don't have time to work on our project.

31
01:25.280 --> 01:27.880
Gosh. It's just a project. What's to worry about?

32
01:27.880 --> 01:29.333
You're just that cool, you know?

33
01:33.733 --> 01:35.244
Jinna.

34
01:35.880 --> 01:37.680
I really like you.

35
01:39.286 --> 01:41.600
What the hell? That came out of nowhere.

36
01:41.600 --> 01:46.222
No. I mean, you're my idol.

37
01:48.733 --> 01:51.793
In both sports and academics.

38
01:53.360 --> 01:56.080
- You play soccer, too? - I do.

39
01:56.080 --> 01:57.160
I played for my school.

40
01:57.160 --> 01:59.600
- You sure you can handle it? - I'm up for any challenge.

41
01:59.600 --> 02:01.960
God damn.

42
02:01.960 --> 02:04.977
- Satang, right? - Yes. I'm Satang.

43
02:04.977 --> 02:06.511
A girly name, right?

44
02:06.511 --> 02:11.880
I wanted a different name, but she insisted on Thai currency names.

45
02:11.880 --> 02:15.520
Why? You've got a cool name. Sounds like you'll make a fortune.

46
02:15.520 --> 02:20.040
Tod, what kind of currency would I be?

47
02:20.040 --> 02:22.755
"Euro?" Because I'm handsome.

48
02:22.755 --> 02:26.977
Judging by your looks, I'd say "bottle caps"

49
02:26.977 --> 02:28.577
because it sounds like "crap."

50
02:28.577 --> 02:30.760
Damn you! You and your foul mouth.

51
02:30.760 --> 02:33.422
My older brother is also named after a currency,

52
02:33.422 --> 02:35.911
but it's obsolete now.

53
02:35.911 --> 02:38.380
What currency is obsolete now?

54
02:39.640 --> 02:41.844
His name is "Podduang."

55
02:41.844 --> 02:44.920
He's a third-year student, just like you.

56
02:44.920 --> 02:46.440
Podduang from the Sports and Health Science?

57
02:46.440 --> 02:47.866
Right on the money.

58
02:47.866 --> 02:48.933
You know him?

59
02:48.933 --> 02:53.680
What, seriously? Podduang is interning at the soccer club.

60
02:53.680 --> 02:56.288
- We know him. - Really?

61
02:56.288 --> 02:58.220
Damn, you know him?

62
02:59.120 --> 03:01.986
Of course. I know him well!

63
03:06.200 --> 03:10.733
Podduang, why didn't you tell me?

64
03:10.733 --> 03:15.113
You get to be in the same club as Jinna, and see him every day.

65
03:15.113 --> 03:17.333
I would've joined too if I'd known.

66
03:18.973 --> 03:20.488
The internship is necessary.

67
03:20.488 --> 03:22.080
I'm not passionate about soccer.

68
03:22.080 --> 03:26.013
No. You know how hot Jinna is, right?

69
03:27.680 --> 03:31.533
Just watching him play soccer is a feast for the eyes.

70
03:31.533 --> 03:34.822
He's great at both academics and sports.

71
03:34.822 --> 03:37.000
He's simply perfect.

72
03:37.000 --> 03:39.646
Dig in already, or it'll get cold.

73
03:42.473 --> 03:44.822
Right, Podduang.

74
03:44.822 --> 03:49.444
Do you know that all the pretty girls at university have a crush on Jinna?

75
03:49.444 --> 03:53.133
I'm so jealous. He's my idol.

76
03:53.133 --> 03:55.444
My friends in the same year also have a crush on him.

77
03:55.444 --> 04:00.440
You have a chance to get close to Jinna, so dig around for me.

78
04:00.440 --> 04:03.986
Find out why he's so perfect and good-looking.

79
04:06.240 --> 04:07.713
Is he already taken?

80
04:10.955 --> 04:12.266
Finish your food already.

81
04:12.266 --> 04:13.993
You're talking too much!

82
04:18.022 --> 04:20.120
[Jinna Ronnarak is calling]

83
04:22.840 --> 04:24.755
Keep eating and don't stop.

84
04:24.755 --> 04:27.080
What the hell? You just won't stop talking.

85
04:27.080 --> 04:28.520
What? What are you waiting for?

86
04:28.520 --> 04:30.840
- I know. - The food's getting cold!

87
04:30.840 --> 04:32.520
Hello.

88
04:32.520 --> 04:34.006
Why are you calling me?

89
04:34.840 --> 04:37.600
Who are you hiding from? Why the whispering?

90
04:37.600 --> 04:39.680
Don't ask.

91
04:39.680 --> 04:41.177
Just tell me what's up.

92
04:41.177 --> 04:44.246
Oh. You're afraid Satang would overhear you.

93
04:45.560 --> 04:47.020
You know Satang, too?

94
04:48.644 --> 04:49.900
Of course.

95
04:50.760 --> 04:52.866
He introduced himself to me

96
04:52.866 --> 04:55.013
as if he wanted to be my little brother.

97
04:56.200 --> 04:59.640
Just ignore him. He's got a few screws loose.

98
04:59.640 --> 05:05.288
Also, don't tell him about our deal, all right?

99
05:05.288 --> 05:07.000
Why?

100
05:07.000 --> 05:08.711
Are you embarrassed?

101
05:08.711 --> 05:10.760
I'm not!

102
05:10.760 --> 05:13.280
I just don't want him to find out.

103
05:13.280 --> 05:16.720
I actually don't want anyone else to do the same.

104
05:16.720 --> 05:20.760
I'm this good-looking, and you're not going to show me off?

105
05:24.366 --> 05:27.288
I only want you to pretend to hit on me.

106
05:27.288 --> 05:28.911
Don't get too attached.

107
05:28.911 --> 05:30.886
I don't like pretending, though.

108
05:34.520 --> 05:37.586
That's not what I meant. I only want you to pretend.

109
05:38.840 --> 05:41.506
You're just that slow, aren't you?

110
05:42.600 --> 05:45.640
How many times do I have to explain it to you?

111
05:45.640 --> 05:49.300
Can you stay with me and keep explaining everything like this?

112
05:50.680 --> 05:53.840
Right. I'm getting sleepy. I'm going to bed.

113
05:53.840 --> 05:56.600
Oh, fine.

114
05:56.600 --> 05:59.940
Why the "Oh"? You called just to mess with me.

115
06:00.840 --> 06:02.913
I want to talk to you, all right?

116
06:03.933 --> 06:05.377
That's it.

117
06:05.377 --> 06:07.244
That's it? What?

118
06:07.244 --> 06:09.640
That's what I call pretending to hit on me.

119
06:09.640 --> 06:14.126
Podduang, I told you I don't like pretending.

120
06:17.133 --> 06:19.733
Right, right. Fine.

121
06:19.733 --> 06:21.933
I'll let you go to sleep, then.

122
06:21.933 --> 06:23.040
Sweet dreams.

123
06:23.040 --> 06:24.760
Sweet dreams, my ass?

124
06:53.080 --> 06:56.044
[Characters, places, and incidents in this production]

125
06:56.044 --> 06:58.530
[are entirely fictitious.]

126
06:58.530 --> 07:00.888
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

127
08:20.720 --> 08:23.946
[Rising Star Awards]

128
08:33.440 --> 08:34.893
This feels like a dream.

129
08:41.240 --> 08:46.422
I dreamed of standing here, receiving the "Rising Star Award,"

130
08:46.422 --> 08:51.580
surrounded by people who applauded me and supported me.

131
08:51.580 --> 08:55.040
I'd like to thank my agency for always taking care of me.

132
08:55.040 --> 08:58.177
I'd also like to thank the crew, my manager,

133
08:58.177 --> 09:02.400
and everyone who played a part in getting me to where I am right now.

134
09:02.400 --> 09:06.400
More importantly, I'd like to thank all my fans,

135
09:06.400 --> 09:11.720
both those who are here today and those watching at home.

136
09:11.720 --> 09:17.473
I promise you that from now on, I'll keep improving myself every single day.

137
09:18.680 --> 09:21.560
Your love really keeps me moving forward.

138
09:21.560 --> 09:24.400
On top of that,

139
09:24.400 --> 09:29.688
I'd like to thank my family for always being right by my side.

140
09:29.688 --> 09:34.155
Finally, I'd like to thank my loved one

141
09:34.155 --> 09:38.340
for always standing right beside me no matter what happens.

142
09:39.920 --> 09:44.000
This award is for you all. Thank you!

143
09:46.040 --> 09:47.440
[Love Anda, Team Anda]

144
09:47.440 --> 09:51.402
- Anda! Anda! Anda! - Anda! Anda! Anda!

145
09:51.402 --> 09:54.006
- Anda, can I take a picture with you? - Absolutely.

146
10:02.577 --> 10:06.233
I'd truly like to thank all of you from the bottom of my heart.

147
10:18.155 --> 10:19.577
[Andaman]

148
10:26.520 --> 10:27.720
Ta-da!

149
10:27.720 --> 10:30.080
- Whoa! - Congratulations, my rising star!

150
10:30.080 --> 10:31.960
Thank you.

151
10:31.960 --> 10:33.400
Here.

152
10:33.400 --> 10:37.000
- Thank you very much. It's gorgeous. - What do you think? Are you tired?

153
10:37.000 --> 10:39.360
I had to talk to so many people, Kum.

154
10:39.360 --> 10:41.044
But you're happy, right?

155
10:41.044 --> 10:45.155
Today, I got to meet my fans.

156
10:45.155 --> 10:49.555
And when I got to thank them in person, I felt really happy.

157
10:49.555 --> 10:52.977
That's good. I'm happy for you too.

158
10:52.977 --> 10:55.533
By the way, did you have anything beforehand?

159
10:55.533 --> 10:58.180
I had dessert at the ceremony.

160
10:58.180 --> 11:02.286
When we get home, I'll order you something delicious, okay?

161
11:03.813 --> 11:06.555
I can't wait to eat the world's largest pizza.

162
11:06.555 --> 11:09.999
Sure thing. Hey, let me see the award!

163
11:11.000 --> 11:13.673
- Wow. - "Anda."

164
11:18.800 --> 11:21.260
[Faculty of Engineering]

165
11:27.640 --> 11:31.560
Our rising star is here!

166
11:31.560 --> 11:32.840
You've got that aura.

167
11:32.840 --> 11:34.440
- Look. - I'm going blind from it.

168
11:34.440 --> 11:36.020
Always with the teasing?

169
11:36.020 --> 11:39.240
Congratulations. I told you you'd win the award either way.

170
11:39.240 --> 11:41.911
Your name is all over the damn media this year.

171
11:41.911 --> 11:44.133
Isn't it because of the backlash?

172
11:44.133 --> 11:46.840
Hey, you're overthinking it.

173
11:46.840 --> 11:50.960
Where there's love, there's hate. That's just how it goes.

174
11:50.960 --> 11:54.977
At least more people love you than hate you.

175
11:54.977 --> 11:58.760
What is certain is that we love you the most.

176
11:58.760 --> 12:00.520
- I'm going to throw up. - How could you say that?

177
12:00.520 --> 12:02.066
So you do know how to say nice things.

178
12:02.066 --> 12:03.311
Of course.

179
12:03.311 --> 12:07.355
The question is, where should we celebrate tonight?

180
12:07.355 --> 12:10.040
- Not this again. - Oh, you prick.

181
12:10.040 --> 12:11.622
- Enough already. - Watch it.

182
12:11.622 --> 12:14.400
So where are we celebrating? Ask Kum to join us, too.

183
12:14.400 --> 12:18.111
Well, a friend's friend's place, then.

184
12:18.111 --> 12:21.155
I'll bring Kum there, too, so I don't have to worry about paparazzi.

185
12:21.155 --> 12:24.288
You're so lucky to have a good boyfriend.

186
12:24.288 --> 12:27.266
Well, of course. I'm already unlucky enough to have you.

187
12:27.266 --> 12:30.320
What? This damn celebrity. You're getting on my nerves.

188
12:30.320 --> 12:31.980
- I'll kick your ass. - Don't.

189
12:32.911 --> 12:34.953
- Don't. - Don't you dare. Ever.

190
12:49.680 --> 12:52.200
Jeez, not going to say hi?

191
12:52.200 --> 12:54.933
We were talking the whole night.

192
12:54.933 --> 12:58.733
Hey. Don't make it sound like that.

193
12:58.733 --> 13:01.044
We were just on the phone.

194
13:01.044 --> 13:02.977
That's what I meant.

195
13:02.977 --> 13:04.406
How did you interpret it?

196
13:06.977 --> 13:08.640
Where are you going after this?

197
13:08.640 --> 13:11.111
To my room, obviously. Satang is waiting for me for dinner.

198
13:11.111 --> 13:14.979
Oh, well. Never mind.

199
13:15.980 --> 13:17.893
Tonight, I'm drinking with my friends.

200
13:20.480 --> 13:23.133
Go on, then. Why are you telling me that?

201
13:23.840 --> 13:27.177
Just letting you know in case I don't call you.

202
13:28.900 --> 13:31.600
No need to wait for me, understand?

203
13:31.600 --> 13:33.020
Who says I do?

204
13:34.280 --> 13:35.840
Are you full of yourself?

205
13:38.480 --> 13:40.360
You're talking nonsense.

206
13:40.360 --> 13:42.506
You're wasting my time here.

207
13:50.866 --> 13:53.755
Lost. You've lost it.

208
13:53.755 --> 13:55.813
You like my friend that much, don't you?

209
13:56.633 --> 13:58.013
That much, yeah.

210
14:04.400 --> 14:08.622
All right, all right. Cheers to my rising star!

211
14:08.622 --> 14:12.040
- All right, cheers. - Yeah.

212
14:12.040 --> 14:14.290
You just love calling me by my award title?

213
14:14.290 --> 14:17.577
It's the opposite of my state, so I'm drinking with you.

214
14:17.577 --> 14:20.280
The series that got put on hold...

215
14:20.280 --> 14:21.920
Gosh! It can stay that way.

216
14:21.920 --> 14:25.400
Your ship partner's a freak. All he cares about is the trend.

217
14:25.400 --> 14:30.777
That day, when he came to our faculty, he was lucky Jinna and I didn't beat him.

218
14:32.160 --> 14:33.640
Try brushing it off.

219
14:33.640 --> 14:37.511
Announcing like that means you respect your loved one,

220
14:37.511 --> 14:40.955
your fans, and yourself.

221
14:40.955 --> 14:42.080
It's true.

222
14:42.080 --> 14:47.400
Winning the award already proves that the community accepts you.

223
14:47.400 --> 14:51.773
In the end, no matter who you are, we're all human, Anda.

224
14:53.800 --> 14:55.622
Right, right, right.

225
14:55.622 --> 14:57.711
I'm trying to stop thinking about it.

226
14:57.711 --> 14:59.577
But you know that, don't you?

227
14:59.577 --> 15:04.453
Even though the whole world accepts me, my family...

228
15:06.044 --> 15:10.200
Enough of that, Anda. Let's stop talking about serious stuff.

229
15:10.200 --> 15:12.110
We're here to celebrate, aren't we?

230
15:12.110 --> 15:13.520
You're right.

231
15:13.520 --> 15:16.222
You guys, why are you all so serious?

232
15:16.222 --> 15:18.080
Come on, a toast.

233
15:18.080 --> 15:20.360
I won't let you off until you're hammered.

234
15:20.360 --> 15:22.046
All right.

235
15:29.888 --> 15:32.320
You're drunk. Take it easy already.

236
15:32.320 --> 15:36.440
Jinna, why don't you find yourself a partner?

237
15:36.440 --> 15:41.600
Just look at mine. He's so handsome and good.

238
15:41.600 --> 15:43.422
Aren't you envious?

239
15:43.422 --> 15:45.222
What the hell?

240
15:45.222 --> 15:47.222
Are you showing off your partner now?

241
15:47.222 --> 15:51.000
I'm not. I'm serious.

242
15:51.000 --> 15:54.900
I'm so damn fortunate to have Kum as my boyfriend.

243
15:59.320 --> 16:00.720
Is that so?

244
16:01.400 --> 16:03.800
I'd be able to go on if I broke up with him?

245
16:05.440 --> 16:07.720
Why do you ask that, Anda?

246
16:07.720 --> 16:10.979
Well, I'm thinking about the worst-case scenario.

247
16:13.273 --> 16:18.000
I'll never break up with you, no matter what.

248
16:22.133 --> 16:23.573
You're so sweet.

249
16:31.000 --> 16:33.780
You pass out every damn time you take a sip.

250
16:33.780 --> 16:36.160
If it weren't for me, you'd probably be missing a kidney now.

251
16:36.160 --> 16:39.133
Take care of me until old age, then.

252
16:39.133 --> 16:41.555
- There, tell that to your boyfriend. - Jinna.

253
16:41.555 --> 16:44.066
I'm going to go back to drinking now.

254
16:44.066 --> 16:46.844
Thanks, Jinna. I'll take it from here.

255
16:46.844 --> 16:49.020
He might throw up in the car, all right?

256
16:49.910 --> 16:53.844
Come, Anda. Let's go home. Careful now.

257
16:53.844 --> 16:56.493
There are steps. Come on.

258
16:57.460 --> 16:58.753
Take a step.

259
17:00.666 --> 17:01.993
Slowly.

260
17:03.800 --> 17:06.400
[Stadium]

261
17:06.400 --> 17:07.977
Careful. Take the ball.

262
17:09.439 --> 17:11.933
Where are Tod and Art?

263
17:11.933 --> 17:14.888
They're talking to a professor. They'll be here soon.

264
17:15.640 --> 17:17.622
I have to leave a bit early, though.

265
17:17.622 --> 17:19.073
Need to take care of something.

266
17:21.240 --> 17:22.880
Go and rest up.

267
17:24.720 --> 17:26.206
We're worried about you.

268
17:36.066 --> 17:37.955
Podduang.

269
17:37.955 --> 17:40.111
Do you need help?

270
17:40.111 --> 17:42.600
It's okay, Anda. I'm used to it now.

271
17:48.973 --> 17:50.020
I think...

272
17:51.100 --> 17:53.000
I need to go now.

273
17:53.000 --> 17:55.311
Tell Tod and Art for me, okay?

274
17:55.311 --> 17:58.900
Right. Don't worry. Stay safe.

275
18:00.040 --> 18:01.280
Bye.

276
18:02.600 --> 18:03.779
Anda!

277
18:06.688 --> 18:08.844
Get some proper rest if you're sleepy.

278
18:08.844 --> 18:10.313
Don't sleep in the car.

279
18:14.355 --> 18:15.506
Okay.

280
18:39.800 --> 18:41.088
Why do you keep staring?

281
18:41.088 --> 18:44.266
Well, do you know Jinna, right?

282
18:44.266 --> 18:47.288
Of course, you've been talking about him daily.

283
18:47.288 --> 18:49.155
No, not like that.

284
18:49.155 --> 18:53.755
I mean, you know each other, don't you?

285
18:53.755 --> 18:57.400
Well, of course we do. I'm an intern at the soccer club.

286
18:58.373 --> 19:02.733
And, like, how well do you know each other?

287
19:04.146 --> 19:06.066
Is it more than just friends?

288
19:06.066 --> 19:09.266
You know what? Just get to the point, Satang.

289
19:10.177 --> 19:11.888
No, well...

290
19:11.888 --> 19:14.320
There's a rumor going around at the university

291
19:14.320 --> 19:18.822
that Jinna is hitting on a Sports and Health Science student.

292
19:18.822 --> 19:22.577
I just want to know who it is.

293
19:22.577 --> 19:26.786
My friends in the faculty say that...

294
19:27.820 --> 19:29.673
He's been hitting on you.

295
19:33.200 --> 19:34.720
Right. Listen up.

296
19:34.720 --> 19:35.800
Jinna and I are just...

297
19:35.800 --> 19:37.088
[Jinna Ronnarak is calling]

298
19:37.088 --> 19:38.244
I knew it!

299
19:38.244 --> 19:41.073
You two are video calling each other.

300
19:41.073 --> 19:42.080
Say it and make my night.

301
19:42.080 --> 19:43.960
You really had to call at the perfect time.

302
19:43.960 --> 19:48.377
If this is nothing important, I'll scold you like there's no tomorrow!

303
19:48.377 --> 19:49.800
Just you wait!

304
19:51.640 --> 19:53.400
Miss you.

305
19:55.844 --> 19:58.640
Aren't you too invested?

306
19:58.640 --> 20:01.620
This is nothing but a play. Don't forget that.

307
20:04.000 --> 20:05.533
Why?

308
20:05.533 --> 20:07.480
Why are we only pretending?

309
20:07.480 --> 20:09.688
I told you I hate pretending.

310
20:09.688 --> 20:14.040
Why? If I actually wanted to hit on you, that wouldn't be okay?

311
20:14.040 --> 20:17.000
You're kidding me, right?

312
20:20.911 --> 20:22.920
You think?

313
20:22.920 --> 20:25.533
God! Why can't you just answer me directly?

314
20:25.533 --> 20:27.320
Why do you always answer me with a question?

315
20:27.320 --> 20:30.444
On top of that, you're making the act feel so real.

316
20:30.444 --> 20:32.160
I'm simple-minded, Jinna.

317
20:32.880 --> 20:34.820
Why do you have to make me feel things?

318
20:36.306 --> 20:38.480
Gotcha! You're talking to Jinna.

319
20:42.622 --> 20:44.400
- Huh? - What do you mean?

320
20:44.400 --> 20:45.920
What? You finished dinner already?

321
20:45.920 --> 20:47.760
Downed the whole thing.

322
20:47.760 --> 20:49.280
Don't be shy.

323
20:49.280 --> 20:51.266
- It's normal. - A grain of rice is on your face.

324
20:51.266 --> 20:54.044
- Is it? - Yeah.

325
20:54.044 --> 20:55.720
Wash your mouth first.

326
20:55.720 --> 20:58.960
No, but you're probably more than just friends, video calling like that.

327
20:58.960 --> 21:00.440
Are you deaf or something?

328
21:00.440 --> 21:02.130
- You still haven't finished yours. - Huh?

329
21:02.130 --> 21:04.240
- Huh? - I'm full already. Hey!

330
21:04.240 --> 21:06.240
Hey!

331
21:06.240 --> 21:07.400
You're full of secrets.

332
21:07.400 --> 21:09.613
- What secrets? I don't have any. - You're lying.

333
22:11.886 --> 22:15.222
Come to think of it, Anda is quite talented, honey.

334
22:15.222 --> 22:21.726
I've heard that for the award ceremony, only big-name actors were invited.

335
22:21.726 --> 22:23.080
Isn't that right, dear?

336
22:23.080 --> 22:24.320
That's right.

337
22:25.120 --> 22:28.666
There are several award categories.

338
22:28.666 --> 22:29.820
Really?

339
22:34.840 --> 22:37.888
I just want this award to prove that

340
22:37.888 --> 22:41.993
I'm doing well on the path I've chosen, Dad.

341
22:43.533 --> 22:48.506
I wonder how prestigious your damn award really is?

342
22:50.093 --> 22:53.320
Were you defending the country?

343
22:53.320 --> 22:57.422
In truth, it's just an award for showbiz people.

344
22:57.422 --> 22:58.746
Worse yet...

345
23:01.219 --> 23:04.480
they're all cut from the same cloth.

346
23:04.480 --> 23:05.577
Honey.

347
23:05.577 --> 23:10.266
When the hell are you going to stop embarrassing me?

348
23:11.080 --> 23:14.644
Why can't you just be on the right track like Itti, your older brother?

349
23:14.644 --> 23:19.955
For Itti to rise to such a high rank in the police,

350
23:19.955 --> 23:22.266
he had to achieve a lot.

351
23:22.266 --> 23:23.840
That's more like it!

352
23:23.840 --> 23:27.720
That's what makes it a profession worthy of respect and pride.

353
23:30.560 --> 23:33.993
So those are the only professions worth being proud of?

354
23:33.993 --> 23:36.880
Do other professions have no prestige or honor at all?

355
23:36.880 --> 23:41.326
Am I that worthless for not fighting a criminal?

356
23:43.400 --> 23:45.800
You're standing here arguing with me nonstop,

357
23:45.800 --> 23:48.879
and you actually expect me to be proud of your stupid award?

358
23:50.800 --> 23:55.320
Do you know that you are the problem in this family?

359
23:55.320 --> 23:57.222
I do!

360
23:57.222 --> 24:03.488
I also know that you, Dad, never consider me part of it.

361
24:03.488 --> 24:09.755
You only consider those you deem useful to you. That's it!

362
24:10.800 --> 24:12.288
Honey!

363
24:12.288 --> 24:15.993
Anda. Are you hurt? Let me see.

364
24:41.293 --> 24:42.400
Anda?

365
25:18.213 --> 25:20.153
I shouldn't have headed home.

366
25:22.480 --> 25:24.473
I shouldn't have gone to see him.

367
25:30.960 --> 25:32.793
You went there so you'd know.

368
25:34.511 --> 25:36.986
So you wouldn't have to wonder about it forever.

369
25:38.240 --> 25:40.160
He doesn't love me at all.

370
25:41.039 --> 25:43.680
He never has.

371
25:43.680 --> 25:45.966
And never will.

372
25:46.920 --> 25:49.253
Don't worry about those who don't love you.

373
25:50.120 --> 25:54.206
Those who don't love you, leave them be.

374
25:56.540 --> 25:57.780
Listen.

375
25:59.726 --> 26:01.760
I love you the most.

376
26:08.480 --> 26:10.720
You're the only one I've got left, Kum.

377
26:13.200 --> 26:14.533
I know.

378
26:17.286 --> 26:19.466
I won't leave you behind either.

379
26:28.533 --> 26:30.060
It's okay.

380
26:46.833 --> 26:49.213
Take a break, everyone. Chop, chop.

381
26:52.266 --> 26:53.740
Go, go, go.

382
26:57.960 --> 26:59.573
Oh, so freaking hot.

383
27:00.780 --> 27:02.155
Jinna.

384
27:02.155 --> 27:06.044
You've been practicing hard today, so I got you some water.

385
27:06.044 --> 27:07.726
For me?

386
27:09.140 --> 27:11.600
Thank you. You didn't have to go to all this trouble.

387
27:11.600 --> 27:14.111
Trouble? I'm happy to do it.

388
27:14.111 --> 27:18.160
And are you in a hurry to go home? I want to talk about the scholarship.

389
27:18.160 --> 27:20.355
Sure thing. I'm not in a hurry.

390
27:20.960 --> 27:22.920
- Want some? - No, you can have it.

391
27:22.920 --> 27:25.280
Are you tired from practicing all day?

392
27:30.777 --> 27:32.780
What's with today?

393
27:50.880 --> 27:54.400
[Anda: See you tomorrow]

394
27:54.400 --> 27:58.333
[Jinna: You're not coming today?]

395
27:58.333 --> 28:00.080
Found you.

396
28:00.866 --> 28:03.400
What? The coach is calling?

397
28:03.400 --> 28:05.711
Not him. It's your fans.

398
28:05.711 --> 28:09.955
They're all waiting to give you snacks like you're a celebrity.

399
28:09.955 --> 28:11.633
You're bullshitting me.

400
28:16.033 --> 28:19.000
I know a lot of people have a crush on you,

401
28:19.000 --> 28:22.355
