402
28:22.355 --> 28:23.760
But...

403
28:24.993 --> 28:28.126
You're serious about my friend, right?

404
28:30.040 --> 28:31.740
Does it seem like I'm not?

405
28:32.553 --> 28:34.480
Don't know.

406
28:34.480 --> 28:37.511
You're half-joking, half-serious.

407
28:37.511 --> 28:39.200
It's not just me.

408
28:39.200 --> 28:42.955
I think even Podduang is confused by your personality.

409
28:42.955 --> 28:47.111
Whatever you're feeling, just say it.

410
28:47.111 --> 28:48.955
Don't play too many games.

411
28:48.955 --> 28:50.377
My friend's dense.

412
28:54.780 --> 28:57.822
If you're not serious, then don't tease him too much.

413
28:57.822 --> 29:00.693
But if you are, go for it. I'm rooting for you.

414
29:05.740 --> 29:07.680
How are you getting home, Jinna?

415
29:07.680 --> 29:10.200
On my motorbike, of course. I do deliveries, so how else?

416
29:10.200 --> 29:12.520
I thought you'd walk home.

417
29:12.520 --> 29:15.160
Gosh. Playing soccer is already killing me.

418
29:16.806 --> 29:19.240
You want a deliveryman to walk home?

419
29:19.240 --> 29:22.244
- Well, you can just... - That'd be too exhausting.

420
29:22.244 --> 29:24.066
Podduang.

421
29:24.066 --> 29:25.688
Take care of this one, too.

422
29:28.520 --> 29:30.199
And...

423
29:32.920 --> 29:35.746
It doesn't matter because I've got delivery jobs after this.

424
29:55.066 --> 29:57.712
Hitting on a girl this late at night,

425
29:59.433 --> 30:01.560
