426
30:03.520 --> 30:05.977
Why do I feel like you're jealous?

427
30:05.977 --> 30:07.690
I'm not!

428
30:07.690 --> 30:13.000
I haven't mentioned who it is, so why did you jump the gun?

429
30:13.000 --> 30:16.088
Or are you really jealous?

430
30:16.088 --> 30:18.680
Why would I be jealous?

431
30:19.653 --> 30:21.111
Quit being full of yourself.

432
30:21.111 --> 30:23.000
Oh?

433
30:23.000 --> 30:27.977
I've been hitting on you this much, and you're still not giving in?

434
30:27.977 --> 30:30.022
Stop the act already.

435
30:30.022 --> 30:31.577
No one's around.

436
30:31.577 --> 30:33.280
No need to roleplay now.

437
30:35.386 --> 30:38.106
Why do you always think that what I do for you isn't genuine?

438
30:40.760 --> 30:44.222
Well. That's just how our deal is.

439
30:44.222 --> 30:46.760
Is it still necessary, Podduang?

440
30:48.340 --> 30:49.993
Can we just ignore it?

441
30:55.760 --> 30:57.926
Just get to the point already.

442
31:01.873 --> 31:04.266
I'm actually going to hit on you.

443
31:04.266 --> 31:06.186
No deals, no ulterior motives.

444
31:09.666 --> 31:12.693
It's just me hitting on you.

445
31:15.373 --> 31:16.933
Is that okay?

446
31:34.360 --> 31:37.600
It's just me hitting on you.

447
31:37.600 --> 31:39.000
Is that okay?

448
31:39.000 --> 31:40.006
Podduang.

449
31:41.426 --> 31:42.686
Podduang.

450
31:44.166 --> 31:45.940
Hey!

451
31:45.940 --> 31:47.444
Podduang!

452
31:47.444 --> 31:49.440
What is it?

453
31:49.440 --> 31:51.486
Why were you so zoned out?

454
31:52.533 --> 31:53.977
I was just thinking about stuff.

455
31:53.977 --> 31:56.355
You took hours to clean that plate.

456
31:56.355 --> 31:58.755
Oh. Don't be ridiculous.

457
32:00.640 --> 32:04.760
Moving on from the economy, we turn to today's breaking news.

458
32:04.760 --> 32:07.720
Tragedy strikes as a famous TV actor

459
32:07.720 --> 32:09.993
- was found dead inside a personal vehicle. - Podduang.

460
32:09.993 --> 32:11.680
- What is it now? - For the latest updates,

461
32:11.680 --> 32:13.320
- Come and see this. - we'll go to our reporter

462
32:13.320 --> 32:15.486
- What news are you talking about? - on the scene.

463
32:17.880 --> 32:20.440
This is considered today's most shocking event.

464
32:20.440 --> 32:23.800
A renowned actor who rose to fame in a hit series, Anda,

465
32:23.800 --> 32:26.400
