467
32:28.600 --> 32:30.640
Preliminarily, authorities speculate that

468
32:30.640 --> 32:33.955
stress from public criticism may have been a contributing factor

469
32:33.955 --> 32:35.640
in his taking his own life.

470
32:35.640 --> 32:40.440
And behind me is the scene where authorities are currently working.

471
32:40.440 --> 32:43.133
There are police officers and forensic investigators

472
32:43.133 --> 32:46.088
carefully examining the scene.

473
32:46.088 --> 32:48.760
This has sent shockwaves through the entertainment industry.

474
32:48.760 --> 32:53.688
Our deepest condolences go out to the victim's family and the actor's fans.

475
32:53.688 --> 32:55.080
Anda? The Engineering student?

476
32:55.080 --> 32:58.480
We will continue to follow this developing story closely

477
32:58.480 --> 33:00.480
and bring you updates as they come in.

478
33:01.840 --> 33:03.688
Hey.

479
33:03.688 --> 33:05.240
That's Anda.

480
33:34.520 --> 33:36.360
Sir, sir!

481
33:36.360 --> 33:37.822
Sir!

482
33:37.822 --> 33:39.006
Sir!

483
33:57.400 --> 34:00.040
This is considered today's most shocking event.

484
34:00.040 --> 34:03.360
A renowned actor who rose to fame in a hit series, Anda,

485
34:03.360 --> 34:05.960
was found dead inside a private vehicle

486
34:05.960 --> 34:08.700
