487
34:10.280 --> 34:11.160
[No way. #WhatHappenedToAnda] [Breaking! Anda Was Found Dead]

488
34:11.160 --> 34:11.960
Preliminarily, [Can't believe he took his own life]

489
34:11.960 --> 34:13.440
authorities speculate that [Who thinks it's a murder case?]

490
34:13.440 --> 34:15.040
stress from public criticism [The police suspect he died of suffocation]

491
34:15.040 --> 34:16.560
may have been a contributing factor [Keyboard detectives, stop]

