The shrimp spirit.

602
42:00.400 --> 42:02.040
The shrimp.

603
42:02.040 --> 42:03.760
- It'll come and get you. - Funny?

604
42:03.760 --> 42:05.893
Obviously. Tod and Art are funny.

605
42:05.893 --> 42:08.488
Come and have a meal with us more often.

606
42:08.488 --> 42:10.573
Come on, we don't have to fight over some shrimp.

607
42:10.573 --> 42:12.040
We can order some more.

608
42:57.880 --> 42:59.193
Jinna.

609
43:00.480 --> 43:01.820
What is it?

610
43:05.640 --> 43:07.286
Are you crying?

611
43:55.853 --> 43:57.800
I'm actually fine.

612
43:57.800 --> 44:02.400
I was riding the motorbike, and the wind made my eyes water.

613
44:04.520 --> 44:05.900
Really?

614
44:11.520 --> 44:13.880
Want me to wash your face in my room?

615
44:14.720 --> 44:16.533
I'm actually not crying, you know?

616
44:17.800 --> 44:21.080
Right. You're not crying.

617
44:21.080 --> 44:23.800
Just come with me and wash your face.

618
44:25.480 --> 44:27.300
Come on. I'll take it off for you.

619
44:37.773 --> 44:38.853
Come on.

620
45:14.360 --> 45:16.046
Satang isn't here?

621
45:17.673 --> 45:18.822
He's away.

622
45:18.822 --> 45:21.066
He'll be back late. He's been with his friends lately.

623
45:30.853 --> 45:32.266
What are you looking at?

624
45:33.080 --> 45:35.040
The one who wasn't crying.

625
45:35.920 --> 45:37.640
You love teasing people?

626
45:45.640 --> 45:47.533
My friend's dead.

627
45:47.533 --> 45:49.160
Let me cry for a bit, okay?

628
45:51.080 --> 45:53.326
I miss him whenever I'm on the road.

629
45:57.320 --> 45:58.506
Jinna.

630
45:59.880 --> 46:05.220
Maybe you don't know it yet, but I really love Anda as an actor.

631
46:07.806 --> 46:10.100
He's my source of joy.

632
46:11.480 --> 46:13.826
It broke my heart when someone insulted him.

633
46:13.826 --> 46:16.400
I was happy when someone complimented him.

634
46:16.400 --> 46:18.640
And when this happened to him,

635
46:21.060 --> 46:22.759
I could barely hold myself together.

636
46:25.059 --> 46:26.753
I just want to tell you that

637
46:28.160 --> 46:31.880
if you're hurting, just let it out.

638
46:31.880 --> 46:34.446
Don't worry about how people will see you.

639
46:36.893 --> 46:39.360
He was your best friend, Jinna.

640
46:40.120 --> 46:41.939
Everyone understands you.

641
46:48.240 --> 46:49.913
Can I hug you?

642
47:56.560 --> 47:58.577
So what is it, Jinna?

643
47:58.577 --> 48:00.840
It's a murder case, isn't it?

644
48:00.840 --> 48:02.800
I don't know.

645
48:02.800 --> 48:04.920
Your guess is as good as mine.

646
48:04.920 --> 48:06.400
Itti.

647
48:06.400 --> 48:12.600
Honestly, do you also think this probably wasn't a suicide?

648
48:12.600 --> 48:14.840
Kum probably has his reasons.

649
48:14.840 --> 48:16.555
He probably wouldn't hurt Anda.

650
48:16.555 --> 48:18.640
Leave this to the police.

651
48:18.640 --> 48:20.311
Don't stick your necks out for anyone.

652
48:20.311 --> 48:23.240
Amp. Are you all right?

653
48:23.240 --> 48:24.500
Why...

654
48:26.400 --> 48:28.520
You must help Anda!

655
48:28.520 --> 48:32.320
Do you also think that Anda was murdered?

656
48:32.320 --> 48:36.177
Then how about we both try to uncover the truth?

657
48:36.177 --> 48:38.693
Let's help Anda.
